1
00:00:03,219 --> 00:00:09,182
Open Artificial Intelligence, Data Sources, click Add Data Source, and click Add on Web.

2
00:00:09,182 --> 00:00:11,719
It is the target for web crawlers.

3
00:00:12,176 --> 00:00:18,829
Enter a Name, and choose the Destination index, the knowledge base index that stores the passages.

4
00:00:18,829 --> 00:00:21,516
It cannot be changed after you save.

5
00:00:21,970 --> 00:00:23,026
Click Save.

6
00:00:23,026 --> 00:00:27,250
The data source is listed, and waits for a crawler to fill it.

